/**
 * PoolFullTriage.hook.ts — start the stale-worktree triage loop when the
 * treehouse worktree pool is full.
 *
 * TRIGGER: PostToolUse, matcher "Bash". Fires only when the Bash RESULT carries
 *   treehouse's refusal "worktrees are in use, dirty, or not provably this
 *   clone's" (fm-spawn: "treehouse get did not enter an isolated worktree").
 *   The command text is ignored, so echoing the phrase does not fire it.
